#original-page(612pt, 792pt, (image("graphics/page-02.png", width: 468pt), 72pt, 47pt))[
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 9.963pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(285.208pt, 43.507pt, "A preprint")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 9.888pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(71.691pt, 81.963pt, "To accelerate the EM simulations, various approximation models have been proposed, including the “domain decompo-")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 9.862pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 92.872pt, "sition method” and the “M3D filter” [1].")
  #line-at(231.387pt, 92.872pt, "These models break down a mask pattern into two-, one-, and zero-dimensional")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 10.007pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 103.781pt, "patterns.")
  #line-at(109.425pt, 103.781pt, "In these models, the electromagnetic (EM) field of a mask pattern is calculated by combining the EM fields")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 10.062pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 114.69pt, "from 2D, 1D, and 0D components.")
  #line-at(216.115pt, 114.69pt, "These models are currently employed in numerous EUV lithography simulation")
  #line-at(72pt, 125.599pt, "tools")
  #line-at(94.966pt, 125.599pt, "[1].")
  #line-at(114.558pt, 125.599pt, "However,")
  #line-at(156.669pt, 125.599pt, "these")
  #line-at(180.742pt, 125.599pt, "models")
  #line-at(213.301pt, 125.599pt, "are")
  #line-at(228.899pt, 125.599pt, "still")
  #line-at(247.353pt, 125.599pt, "very")
  #line-at(268.459pt, 125.599pt, "resource-intensive")
  #line-at(345.75pt, 125.599pt, "and")
  #line-at(363.625pt, 125.599pt, "do")
  #line-at(376.978pt, 125.599pt, "not")
  #line-at(393.165pt, 125.599pt, "take")
  #line-at(413.184pt, 125.599pt, "into")
  #line-at(432.197pt, 125.599pt, "account")
  #line-at(466.991pt, 125.599pt, "the")
  #line-at(482.61pt, 125.599pt, "nonlocality")
  #line-at(531.529pt, 125.599pt, "of")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 9.963pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 136.508pt, "electromagnetic interaction.")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 9.893pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 152.897pt, "Recently, many attempts have been made to simulate the 3D effects of masks using deep neural networks (DNNs) such")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 9.997pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 163.806pt, "as convolutional neural networks (CNNs) [2], generative adversarial network (GAN) or U-Net [3,4].")
  #line-at(478.651pt, 163.806pt, "However, these")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 9.862pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 174.715pt, "neural network approaches are based on supervised learning, require fairly extensive datasets, have a significant training")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 9.963pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 185.624pt, "time, and often do not demonstrate the necessary accuracy of the solution and the degree of its generalization.")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 10.022pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 202.012pt, "In this paper, we present physics-informed neural networks [5")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 9.963pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(321.343pt, 202.012pt, "–")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 10.022pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(326.324pt, 202.012pt, "7] and neural operators [8,9] for solving the problem")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 10.062pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 212.922pt, "of diffraction of extreme ultraviolet electromagnetic waves from 3D masks.")
  #line-at(383.024pt, 212.922pt, "The training of these neural systems is")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 9.903pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 223.831pt, "performed in an unsupervised manner, leveraging the governing physical equations directly in the training process.")
  #line-at(527.132pt, 223.831pt, "We")
  #set text(font: "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu", size: 9.933pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 234.74pt, "evaluate the performance and accuracy of the neural network systems on benchmark problems and on realistic 2D and")
